        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle LUMORA PLATFORM - LEARNING, ASSESSMENT &amp; CERTIFICATION\nskinparam linetype ortho\nskinparam shadowing false\n\nskinparam Swimlane {\n    TitleFontColor #000000\n    TitleFontSize 15\n    BorderColor #2c384e\n    BorderThickness 2\n}\n\nskinparam Activity {\n    BackgroundColor #2b78b8\n    BorderColor #1f5a8a\n    FontColor #FFFFFF\n    FontSize 12\n    RoundCorner 25\n    DiamondBackgroundColor #d9534f\n    DiamondBorderColor #b52b27\n    BarColor #f0ad4e\n    StartColor #2c384e\n    EndColor #2c384e\n}\n\nskinparam Arrow {\n    Color #555555\n    FontColor #000000\n    FontSize 12\n}\n\n|Student|\nstart\n:Open Enrolled Course;\n:Select Lesson to Watch;\n\n|Azure &amp; External Services|\n:Generate Signed Video URL;\n:Stream Video via Azure CDN;\n\n|Student|\nfork\n    :Watch Video in Video.js Player;\nfork again\n    :Take Notes / Bookmark Lesson;\nfork again\n    :Ask Question in Q&amp;A;\nend fork\n\n|Lumora Platform|\n:Mark Lesson Complete;\n:Update Progress Bar (Progress.js);\n\n|Student|\n:Attempt Section / Course Quiz;\n\n|Lumora Platform|\n:Verify Answers &amp; Show Explanations;\n\nif () then ([Score &gt;= Passing Score])\n    :Check Total Course Completion;\n    if () then ([100% Completed])\n        :Trigger Observer Pattern;\n        :Generate PDF Certificate (iTextSharp);\n        fork\n            |Student|\n            :Download Certificate &amp; Share on LinkedIn;\n            :Rate &amp; Review Course / Vote Helpful;\n        fork again\n            |Azure &amp; External Services|\n            :Send Certificate Issuance Alert;\n        end fork\n    else ([Incomplete Course])\n        |Student|\n        :Proceed to Next Lesson;\n    endif\nelse ([Score &lt; Passing Score])\n    |Lumora Platform|\n    :Enforce Quiz Retake;\n    |Student|\n    :Review Explanations &amp; Retry;\nendif\n\n|Student|\nstop\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="v281P9ACCbJfuL08H2Cz-73">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
